{"kind":"notes","id":"nt/ct84z5","slide":1,"text":"Welcome to Evaluate What Changed in Health. This lesson begins with one principle: observed change is not automatically programme impact. We will connect that principle to an accountable health decision and make it testable in the companion notebook.\n\n[Sources]\n- Canonical notebook V7_B_N14, SRAI Book 7 v1.0."}
