{"kind":"notes","id":"nt/ztmhpr","slide":3,"text":"These five controls form one operating chain. We begin with counterfactual, move through implementation and outcomes, and finish with equity and uncertainty. Every control must be explicit, reviewable, and owned.\n\n[Sources]\n- Canonical notebook V7_B_N14, SRAI Book 7 v1.0."}
