{"kind":"notes","id":"nt/grd6m5","slide":5,"text":"The notebook converts the lesson into executable evidence. Evaluate a health intervention with counterfactual and implementation evidence. As you review the saved outputs, focus on what the evidence supports, what remains uncertain, and the condition that requires abstention or escalation.\n\n[Sources]\n- Canonical notebook V7_B_N14, SRAI Book 7 v1.0."}
