{"kind":"textbox","id":"sh/zitw32tk","slide":8,"text":"If one critical answer is missing, pause and refer for review.","textPreview":"If one critical answer is missing, pause and refer for review.","textChars":62,"textLines":1,"bbox":[58,568,1050,44]}
{"kind":"notes","id":"nt/bbzojh","slide":8,"text":"Before deployment, ask five questions. Is counterfactual clear? Is implementation documented? Is outcomes testable? Is equity governed? And is uncertainty explicit? If one critical answer is missing, pause and refer the system for review.\n\n[Sources]\n- Canonical notebook V7_B_N14, SRAI Book 7 v1.0."}